                                "sense_id": "f63288e3-630b-304b-b83f-6e03c8898974",
                                "text": "...Apathist alone, equally superior to the violent attacks of passion, and the teasing impertinence of fretfulness..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b55ecb0-29fa-44b5-b259-58e2fdedaec6",
                                "sense_id": "f63288e3-630b-304b-b83f-6e03c8898974",
                                "text": "...apathist is thought despicable not simply because he is indifferent but because he is indifferent to something others regard as so vital as to require everyone's or at least certain others' concern."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8bc4144-7cd4-4e20-b797-b7d4abba0981",
                                "sense_id": "f63288e3-630b-304b-b83f-6e03c8898974",
                                "text": "...apathist, of one \"whom man delighteth not, nor woman either.\""
